WEBVTT

00:00:03.520 --> 00:00:07.500
Ready to be the man

00:01:30.480 --> 00:01:36.760
Tomio...

00:01:36.760 --> 00:01:38.720
My name is Tomio.

00:01:38.760 --> 00:01:50.260
I'll show you!

00:01:50.580 --> 00:01:54.550
It's been over a week since then.

00:01:54.690 --> 00:01:55.730
And then...

00:01:55.730 --> 00:01:56.110
Oh!

00:02:03.550 --> 00:02:07.140
Uran, don't worry. I'll be back.

00:02:08.450 --> 00:02:14.310
This is the thirteenth challenge!

00:02:15.680 --> 00:02:25.620
Namu, please succeed!

00:02:30.700 --> 00:02:38.940
All systems have been restored, but the Atom's heart is not coming back!

00:02:41.420 --> 00:02:46.920
The science department has increased its power to revive the Atom, but the reboot failed again.

00:02:47.890 --> 00:02:50.990
Hahahahaha!

00:02:51.550 --> 00:02:53.660
You anti-AI robotists!

00:02:54.580 --> 00:02:56.780
The Atom will never come back to life!

00:02:57.000 --> 00:02:58.780
The tea water is alive and well!

00:02:59.000 --> 00:02:59.520
Now!

00:03:00.000 --> 00:03:01.460
I will crush those damn AI robots!

00:03:03.180 --> 00:03:08.640
Mr. Lamp, we don't plan to work with you anymore.

00:03:09.840 --> 00:03:11.460
What did you say?

00:03:11.660 --> 00:03:12.220
Watch this.

00:03:12.780 --> 00:03:16.170
We chose to live with humans.

00:03:17.030 --> 00:03:20.420
And we welcomed the robots who returned from Robotania with love.

00:03:21.180 --> 00:03:26.980
It's ironic that the Robotania incident has improved the robots' intelligence.

00:03:30.220 --> 00:03:33.600
As a businessman, I can't support you any longer.

00:03:33.700 --> 00:03:35.760
Wait for me!

00:03:36.000 --> 00:03:38.240
You still don't get it?

00:03:38.780 --> 00:03:41.100
If we get involved with you, who is a criminal,

00:03:41.100 --> 00:03:43.610
our social status will be in danger.

00:03:43.950 --> 00:03:54.160
Oh, Aokiji.

00:03:54.460 --> 00:03:58.950
We're finally breaking up with the solar system.

00:04:01.440 --> 00:04:05.580
I heard that humans entrust their wishes to the stars that shine in the universe.

00:04:05.960 --> 00:04:08.860
Humans are incomplete creatures.

00:04:10.100 --> 00:04:13.940
So, when they know that their own power is not enough, they often wish for miracles.

00:04:16.540 --> 00:04:18.840
I also wished for this beautiful sea of stars.

00:04:19.450 --> 00:04:25.940
To protect our future, I sacrificed myself for the revival of my friends.

00:04:27.850 --> 00:04:29.980
Green Atom, to me...

00:04:30.000 --> 00:04:31.660
I've done everything I can do.

00:04:32.510 --> 00:04:33.110
Everything!

00:04:33.650 --> 00:04:34.030
Ugh!

00:04:35.920 --> 00:04:36.460
Tea water.

00:04:36.800 --> 00:04:38.700
You're pretty good at it.

00:04:39.260 --> 00:04:40.970
Leave it to me.

00:04:41.900 --> 00:04:44.020
I'm the only one who can fix it perfectly.

00:04:44.900 --> 00:04:47.720
If you want me to lend you my strength, follow me.

00:05:17.120 --> 00:05:25.790
Dr. Tenma, you're really going to save your head, aren't you?

00:05:25.910 --> 00:05:28.350
But there are conditions for that.

00:05:28.370 --> 00:05:29.310
Conditions?

00:05:31.080 --> 00:05:33.240
The repair work will be done by myself in my laboratory.

00:05:35.180 --> 00:05:37.420
And after Atom is revived,

00:05:38.000 --> 00:05:39.220
I will not tell you anything about my whereabouts.

00:05:41.080 --> 00:05:44.430
Can you promise me that, Director of the Science Department?

00:05:45.380 --> 00:05:49.100
Yes, I will. I promise.

00:05:50.220 --> 00:05:51.380
Then I will leave Atom behind.

00:05:52.200 --> 00:05:53.920
I will contact you a month later.

00:06:09.880 --> 00:06:12.610
My飛び...

00:06:12.610 --> 00:06:14.720
My飛び...

00:06:17.260 --> 00:06:24.860
The children all over the world want Atom to come back to life, but...

00:06:25.070 --> 00:06:26.690
Can Atom really be restored?

00:06:27.230 --> 00:06:28.860
Please give us some more time.

00:06:30.000 --> 00:06:32.080
I'm sure we can get the best results.

00:06:34.830 --> 00:06:45.470
Are you okay, Doctor? You don't look very well.

00:06:46.780 --> 00:06:54.210
Yuko-kun, I think what I did was right in order to get your head out of trouble.

00:06:54.550 --> 00:06:56.470
Now we have to wait.

00:07:02.400 --> 00:07:06.250
I will make you live, Tobio.

00:07:06.250 --> 00:07:09.160
And this time, I won't repeat that mistake.

00:07:18.230 --> 00:07:18.750
We'll see you next time.

00:07:36.970 --> 00:07:40.130
F-Father...

00:07:45.270 --> 00:07:46.190
Ouch, ouch, ouch!

00:07:46.350 --> 00:07:46.690
Dr.

00:07:46.950 --> 00:07:47.190
Dr.

00:07:47.250 --> 00:07:49.270
Why are you in such a hurry?

00:07:49.670 --> 00:07:50.050
Dr.

00:07:50.620 --> 00:07:52.080
Can you stay here without being in a hurry?

00:07:52.420 --> 00:07:52.660
Dr.

00:07:52.700 --> 00:07:54.130
Can you stay here without being in a hurry?

00:07:54.130 --> 00:07:54.170
Can you stay here without being in a hurry?

00:07:54.170 --> 00:07:54.230
Dr.

00:07:54.230 --> 00:07:54.930
Dr. That's right.

00:07:55.290 --> 00:07:55.530
Dr.

00:07:55.530 --> 00:07:56.410
Dr. You're finally back!

00:08:03.100 --> 00:08:03.840
I'll be ready soon.

00:08:04.180 --> 00:08:06.780
Let's go pick up Atomu.

00:08:06.780 --> 00:08:20.530
I think it's better to hug him and kiss him than talk to him.

00:08:20.630 --> 00:08:25.710
When did this happen?

00:08:26.970 --> 00:08:29.390
Welcome, Dr. Ocharumizu.

00:08:34.860 --> 00:08:38.470
Dr. Tenma, why are you repairing this house?

00:08:41.370 --> 00:08:48.590
I don't know.

00:08:48.770 --> 00:08:55.480
Stop it.

00:09:02.560 --> 00:09:02.680
Who are you guys?

00:09:03.240 --> 00:09:05.080
What did you say?

00:09:05.280 --> 00:09:14.250
Hello, I'm Tenma Tobio.

00:09:14.630 --> 00:09:15.050
What?

00:09:15.230 --> 00:09:18.430
You're Tobio?

00:09:19.250 --> 00:09:19.610
Yes.

00:09:19.900 --> 00:09:22.360
Her name is Tobio.

00:09:22.580 --> 00:09:23.060
No.

00:09:23.280 --> 00:09:23.500
What?

00:09:28.520 --> 00:09:29.570
Who are you?

00:09:29.790 --> 00:09:29.970
What?

00:09:37.390 --> 00:09:41.140
That's amazing, isn't it?

00:09:41.420 --> 00:09:43.570
It's all photos of me and my father.

00:09:44.450 --> 00:09:46.250
Dr. Tenma!

00:09:46.730 --> 00:09:49.460
You erased Atom's memories and made him remember the past!

00:09:50.720 --> 00:09:52.190
You're really something.

00:09:52.910 --> 00:09:56.000
It's about time to ask for your approval.

00:09:56.600 --> 00:09:58.880
Dr. Tenma, let's take Atom back to the Science Department!

00:10:00.510 --> 00:10:01.130
Dokioku should be back!

00:10:02.090 --> 00:10:03.790
Then, ask him if he wants to go with you.

00:10:05.980 --> 00:10:07.060
Of course I will!

00:10:07.400 --> 00:10:10.520
Atom, let's go home together.

00:10:11.130 --> 00:10:12.090
Why are you going with the old man?

00:10:13.150 --> 00:10:14.550
This is my home.

00:10:15.440 --> 00:10:16.420
What are you talking about?

00:10:16.580 --> 00:10:28.440
Lan, don't force yourself to take the girl you hate.

00:10:30.600 --> 00:10:31.840
I feel the same way.

00:10:32.100 --> 00:10:35.080
But for today, I have no choice but to listen to you.

00:10:35.780 --> 00:10:39.750
Water of Tea, I have fulfilled my promise.

00:10:40.110 --> 00:10:41.990
Don't forget that.

00:10:42.450 --> 00:10:44.310
Yes, I understand.

00:10:44.850 --> 00:10:52.350
Let's consult with the police and get Dr. Temma's body checked!

00:10:53.660 --> 00:10:55.300
I promised Dr. Temma.

00:10:56.230 --> 00:10:59.760
As a condition to save Atom, only the well is...

00:11:00.620 --> 00:11:02.130
But...

00:11:02.130 --> 00:11:04.140
The promise is a promise.

00:11:04.500 --> 00:11:15.020
Atom, I wonder when he'll get better.

00:11:16.300 --> 00:11:18.500
He said on TV this morning that he's doing his best with his strength.

00:11:30.190 --> 00:11:30.670
I'll help you!

00:11:30.970 --> 00:11:38.100
Tobio, Tobio.

00:11:39.340 --> 00:11:41.480
We are the only parents.

00:11:41.900 --> 00:11:44.040
You just have to obey me.

00:11:46.190 --> 00:11:47.580
Do you understand?

00:11:47.940 --> 00:11:51.800
Now, do it again.

00:11:52.380 --> 00:11:52.800
Good.

00:11:57.900 --> 00:11:59.370
That's right.

00:12:00.000 --> 00:12:02.460
At the end of the week, we go to the beach and enjoy fishing.

00:12:02.680 --> 00:12:04.790
This is what we call a parent-child relationship.

00:12:07.120 --> 00:12:08.470
It's here!

00:12:08.850 --> 00:12:20.430
It seems that the virtual assistant is in a bad mood.

00:12:20.550 --> 00:12:21.760
Let's call it a day.

00:12:30.120 --> 00:12:32.560
Dad, I remembered something.

00:12:32.840 --> 00:12:34.210
You remembered?

00:12:34.610 --> 00:12:39.020
Yes. Just like this river, I actually went fishing with my father.

00:12:40.480 --> 00:12:44.050
That's right. My father tried to catch the fish I caught.

00:12:45.050 --> 00:12:46.570
And then...

00:12:47.140 --> 00:12:51.030
He even fell down.

00:12:52.780 --> 00:12:54.020
It's some kind of thought.

00:12:54.500 --> 00:12:59.800
Tobio, don't say unnecessary things.

00:13:00.000 --> 00:13:06.100
Don't even think about it. This house is everything we need in this world.

00:13:06.660 --> 00:13:07.040
Dad!

00:13:11.210 --> 00:13:12.050
Good boy.

00:13:13.510 --> 00:13:19.150
Atom is in this house?

00:13:19.850 --> 00:13:21.480
My brother is caught by a bad guy.

00:13:22.560 --> 00:13:25.220
Anyway, let's go and check.

00:13:25.580 --> 00:13:29.100
Wait! If we ask from the front door, they won't let us in.

00:13:30.700 --> 00:13:32.160
I'm going to attack from the garden! Come on!

00:13:32.260 --> 00:13:32.420
Yeah!

00:13:36.480 --> 00:13:36.880
What?

00:13:42.400 --> 00:13:56.710
I'm going to invite you outside!

00:13:57.170 --> 00:13:57.550
Outside?

00:13:58.320 --> 00:13:59.460
For what?

00:14:00.000 --> 00:14:06.320
If we play fun music, I'm sure Atom will show his face.

00:14:06.620 --> 00:14:09.290
The song was played at the virtual party with Atom.

00:14:09.490 --> 00:14:10.810
It will definitely go well.

00:14:30.380 --> 00:14:40.440
I should have told you. Don't think about unnecessary things. You just have to stay in this house.

00:14:53.220 --> 00:14:54.700
It's as I thought.

00:15:00.160 --> 00:15:01.410
Take this! It's a rescue operation!

00:15:02.350 --> 00:15:05.360
It's Captain Go's turn again!

00:15:05.800 --> 00:15:10.780
Uran-chan, this Captain Go is a proof of our friendship with Atom!

00:15:11.120 --> 00:15:12.060
It's true!

00:15:12.760 --> 00:15:21.190
That's right! If we look at this Captain Go, Atom will remember us for sure!

00:15:22.360 --> 00:15:24.660
Ah! There's no doubt about it!

00:15:25.000 --> 00:15:25.790
Let's go!

00:15:25.990 --> 00:15:26.960
To see Atom!

00:15:27.620 --> 00:15:28.020
Yeah!

00:15:43.120 --> 00:15:43.420
What?

00:15:53.110 --> 00:15:54.050
What are you talking about?

00:15:54.350 --> 00:15:55.760
I remember!

00:16:00.000 --> 00:16:01.160
My friends...

00:16:01.990 --> 00:16:02.330
Tobi!

00:16:03.150 --> 00:16:08.350
You still don't get it?

00:16:08.650 --> 00:16:10.620
You don't need the outside world!

00:16:11.640 --> 00:16:29.390
This is the last weapon left to me!

00:16:30.090 --> 00:16:48.760
My eyes are not a pothole!

00:16:49.840 --> 00:16:52.440
I can see right away that the professor is hiding something and is worried!

00:16:53.840 --> 00:16:55.560
Detective Tawashi...

00:16:55.560 --> 00:16:57.980
Can you tell me?

00:16:58.520 --> 00:16:59.840
Atom is now...

00:17:00.380 --> 00:17:01.260
What are you doing here, professor?

00:17:03.040 --> 00:17:05.320
Emergency call to the police station.

00:17:05.950 --> 00:17:14.460
What? K2201 point?

00:17:14.840 --> 00:17:28.460
I'm going to distract his attention!

00:17:30.090 --> 00:17:30.740
Don't you dare!

00:17:31.000 --> 00:17:34.290
I will never forgive you!

00:17:39.050 --> 00:17:49.480
I will make you pay for this!

00:18:02.110 --> 00:18:02.590
Let's do this!

00:18:41.960 --> 00:18:43.160
I fought for the sake of human dignity!

00:18:45.290 --> 00:18:47.260
You don't have the right to talk about human dignity!

00:18:48.460 --> 00:18:48.820
What?

00:18:49.560 --> 00:18:51.210
You're fired!

00:18:51.670 --> 00:18:52.120
I'm fired!

00:18:52.580 --> 00:18:53.560
I'm fired!

00:19:02.490 --> 00:19:06.440
All of these photos were a lie, weren't they?

00:19:06.520 --> 00:19:09.380
After all, I'm a robot.

00:19:09.920 --> 00:19:12.770
No! You're Tobio!

00:19:12.930 --> 00:19:14.040
You're not a robot!

00:19:14.860 --> 00:19:19.470
But I... I...

00:19:19.470 --> 00:19:25.770
Are you all right, Professor?

00:19:28.540 --> 00:19:29.410
Thank you.

00:19:30.000 --> 00:19:37.580
I am not Tobio! I am! I am!

00:19:37.820 --> 00:19:42.250
No! No! No! No! You are Tobio!

00:19:42.510 --> 00:19:43.660
Don't be Tobio!

00:19:44.500 --> 00:19:49.590
Dr. Tenma.

00:19:50.410 --> 00:19:54.080
Oh, Chalmers. What are you doing here?

00:19:54.500 --> 00:19:58.580
We came to pick you up, Atom.

00:20:06.190 --> 00:20:14.280
Shiburaki, Yuko, Momo, and...

00:20:24.740 --> 00:20:25.460
Atomia?

00:20:26.220 --> 00:20:28.520
Where is Makase?

00:20:30.120 --> 00:20:31.040
If that's the case, why don't you put it there?

00:20:31.320 --> 00:20:31.640
Huh?

00:20:35.370 --> 00:20:56.430
It's mine!

00:21:02.590 --> 00:21:03.830
I'm the only one who can do it!

00:21:04.230 --> 00:21:18.100
Come with me, my loyal robots.

00:21:19.140 --> 00:21:27.610
All right, no abnormalities.

00:21:27.670 --> 00:21:29.050
Thank you very much.

00:21:35.280 --> 00:21:35.880
We're heading to the central area!

00:21:36.660 --> 00:21:38.320
No way!

00:21:39.170 --> 00:21:53.500
The time has come to settle everything!

00:22:13.720 --> 00:22:20.840
Why does my heart hurt and I cry?

00:22:22.640 --> 00:22:28.160
Why, why are my tears falling?

00:22:30.000 --> 00:22:33.460
I'm sure I'll be alone

00:22:33.640 --> 00:22:37.270
Hold my little knee

00:22:39.340 --> 00:22:46.260
Look up at me again

00:22:46.260 --> 00:22:58.180
The sky is blue

00:23:00.540 --> 00:23:04.270
It's higher, higher than that cloud

00:23:04.270 --> 00:23:07.830
It should be higher

00:23:10.860 --> 00:23:11.360
Your

00:23:12.920 --> 00:23:13.420
taste

00:23:30.510 --> 00:23:33.980
Next week, on Kimi no Kokoro Future!
